00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:08.099
Glen Campbell was a country boy who made
it big with success in music television

00:00:08.099 --> 00:00:14.429
and film he was born in a small town in
Arkansas around 1960 the young musician

00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:18.330
moved to Los Angeles becoming a session
musician playing for the likes of Dean

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.390
Martin Elvis Presley Frank Sinatra and
Meryl Haggard but it wasn't until 1967

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:28.760
that he hit it big with the release of
two blockbuster albums

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:33.570
gentle on my mine which won two Grammy
Awards and by the time I get to Phoenix

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:40.350
also garnering two Grammys Campbell was
on a hot streak and in 1968 came Wichita

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:48.000
Lineman sitting on Billboard's Hot 100
charts for 15 weeks

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.829
Campbell capitalized on this popularity
and turned to television from 1969

00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:58.890
through 1972 he hosted a variety show
the Glen Campbell goodtime hour he also

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:03.350
tried his hand as an actor co-starring
in the iconic film True Grit and

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:11.790
performing the theme song which went on
to be nominated for an Academy Award but

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:16.439
in the midst of his success Campbell
became ensnared in controversy his

00:01:16.439 --> 00:01:20.640
on-again off-again relationship with
singer Tanya Tucker became tabloid

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:25.290
fodder he also battled an alcohol and
drug addiction that he would later kick

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:29.189
I just welcomed said I can I can quit
this I know I can and I was like I said

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.939
I prayed and I prayed

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.860
but Campbell continued to enjoy musical
success the song rhinestone Cowboys shot

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:43.440
to number one on the Billboard charts in
1975 and he'd peak again in 77 with the

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:49.260
song southern night in 2005 the star was
inducted into the Country Music Hall of

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:55.200
Fame but in 2011 he shocked the music
world with a stunning announcement what

00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:03.390
they diagnosed me is Alzheimer's
Alzheimer's mm-hmm what's all Alzheimer

